WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Now you eat commercial food and get paid

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,600
I'm just a country girl with no education

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:05,560
The family is poor

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,680
Mother is sick

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,960
My brother is still young

6
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,560
She is afraid that I will become a worker

7
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:13,200
Just look down on her

8
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,510
what did you get

9
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:18,350
I pickled the appetizer myself

10
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,190
My mother said you live alone

11
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:21,630
Maybe there is no food

12
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:28,020
Silly girl

13
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,300
I entered the residence

14
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,860
It’s to live a better life

15
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,540
Protect those you want to protect

16
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:36,820
Not to look down on anyone

17
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,220
You are a country girl

18
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,010
I also came from the countryside.

19
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,810
Qin Laosun is not my Qin father

20
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:44,500
I don’t even know who my parents are

21
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,600
At least you have a mother who loves you

22
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:51,810
Have a sensible brother

23
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:54,010
I never thought you weren't good enough for me

24
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:56,810
You, Mr. Qin, are kind and filial

25
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:58,490
These are more important than identity

26
00:00:58,490 --> 00:00:59,690
But others say
